@Passage-Section PTRAN parallelizing compiler research
@Passage-Text We built an experimental compiler; followed actually the model that Dave Kuck had of being able to have an ongoing compiling system that one could measure the effectiveness of applying all kinds of parallelization and analysis techniques to programs in order to understand the value and how they interacted with each other.
@Passage-Context Allen describes the PTRAN team's experimental compiler for studying parallelization and program analysis techniques.
